{
  "id": "EZK.33",
  "number": "33",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Esekieli 33",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA ghwaloat Esekieli ghoah furiischoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, abaloola fugaagu nea giyeeshi saawa, inyas geayeadu ng'ucheeda badayda ng'eanyiida, fugeaba ng'eanyiita gaygageanu siyagi aba jeenyaawa ak geanung' ghoah furiischoocheanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidaahaan ng'ucheeda nea ghwahidu jeeda ng'eanyiita, gayghaghuut durumbeati nea ghamiin gheang'da buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi giliwas sih iiyiiy ghuuta durumbeati, ak ea maduupa gil, asi iihidu ng'ucheeda ak geabwar, abeeda foojeandaanyi gaygwanda badaydaanyi nea gaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ghwayiiy ghuuta durumbeati, ak ea maduupeewana gil, foojeandaanyi gaygwanda badaydaanyi, nea gwachi iimwas miinda gheang'da abeeda gwachi gayghoaghu gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea furiischoocheanda iidaah weajoocheanda nea ghwahidu ak ea mwaghuuda durumbeati, nea mareekusiina buuneeda, ak ghwahidu weajoocheanda ak ghabwar siida was sean aba jeenyaawa, abeeda nih gayghabwar ng'asheagaaschi munyas nea abeeda eaweagaaschi gaydang'al furiischoocheanji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ang'iing'i siida naanung' woosa furiischoocheanda fuga Israeli, asi iinya ng'asheanji leabu ghuuteanyuun, ak girukusi saawa reekusiinda leabu heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas geayeeshi siida muy seara Ea orjeeda siida muy seara, aba huumwa gaymeawa, nea ang'iing'i ea mirukusiini ng'asheanda reekusiinda jea ghwanung'waadawa siida naweadaanyi muy, siisi muyiin abeeda inyas ghami nea gaba ng'asheagaaschi munyas, abeeda eaweagaaschi gaydang'alnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iireekusi siida muy aba badayda ng'asheagaaschi munyas gideaba ghwanung'waada, ak ea mwanung'waada abeeda gayghami siisi nea gaba ng'asheagaaschi munyas, nea abeeda ang'iing'i ea niighuuhi eaweagaagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeeda giliwas sih",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ang'iing'i orjeeda siida abaloola fuga Israeli, agooga gooyeenyi gideaba ‘giidiinyeanyeekaasa ea riing'eegaasa deanya gil, Ak aseasa ea niisha uurjeengaasa aba riing'eesu, asi gajeamuustaan eepiidana?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeshiina aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, meahoosani aba miyeeda siida muy, geagasayi gideaba siida muy ghoabuut naweadingaaschi munyas, ak ghwanyas giibinda. Aduukuunana, aduukuunana, ak ghoanung'waadi naweadingeagwa munyas, ghwasaan anda googasayi ameewa, Ea fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i siida, abaloola fugaagu, siida doabiiwaat mayghoaghu doobiiwnataanyi, aba eaweeda giidiinyeandaanyi; ea aba badayda munyinda siida muy, mayghoabeeda aba badaydeaba munyin, eaweeda jea gwaduukuuna ak ghwanung'waada munyindaanyi, nea dea doabiiwaat mayghoamu aba doobiiwnataanyi, eaweedida jea gwasina riing'eedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geaheeleesi siida doabiiwaat gideaba, gayghwanyas giibinda, nea niny inyas iibeachi gideaba gwadeay doobiiwnataanyi, ak ghoang'eat sinooda ng'asheega munyas, abeeda sinaweagaaschi sean munyas bea mwadi maygudu eapkaat, gayghami aba munyindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gicha iyeayeeshi siida muy gideaba ‘aba huumwa gaymeawa,’ ak iiduukuuna ak ghwanung'waada riing'eadaanyi, ak gwasin gea doobiiweadi hidaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida muy inyas ghoadealda gida ghayi alaach aba heeda siida, nea goodeelsa siida haleanjeadaanyi ghayi areat, nea ghwaat geeshta deaweedeeda eaweega, nea masina ng'asheanda muy was sean, abeeda gayghwanyas giibinda may ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda riing'eagaaschi sean ghayi sin manda dea jea eapkaat doobiiweadi hidaat, aba huumwa gayghwanyas giibinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea fugaagu gwayi, ‘naweeda Ng'utamiida mii doabiiwaat’; nea fiisu naweadinga nyaawa ea miidoobiiweadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida doabiiwaat iinung'waada doobiiwnataanyi, ak ghoang'eat ghuuta sinooda, abeeda gayghami aba ng'asheagaaschi munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida muy iinung'waada ng'asheagaaschi munyas, ak gwasin gea doobiiweadi hidaat, abeeda gayghwanyas giibinda aba sinaweagaaschi miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gooyeenyi, ‘Naweeda Ng'utamiida mii doabiiwaat’ Ea fuga gheeh Israeli, gaydeargweakseegwa gaba nih aadawji giteena sinaweagaaschi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiineeda Yerusalemu siing'waay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damaniyeenya bea giibaleakteanya, bea sheedeaba damanamughuush, eaweedeaba muut bea sheeda, abeeda gwanda siisi waapta leabu Yerusalemu. Ak ghwahidu ak gwayeeshiinean, “Mujiineeda Yerusalemu siing'waay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA abeeda gwanda badaydeanyu, shing'ada nea mii ghwahidu siidida waaptaan, nea niny abeeda ea ninung' ghwajaada ghuuteanyu. Damanda hina heedeanyu sakteayda abeeda ea nijaada ghuuteanyu, nea ghaamuuschi baloolda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riing'eeda buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, fugiga mida ng'eanyiida was raghoonyeandean, aba ng'eanyiida Israeli, inyeessa gwayi, ‘Abrahamu ghayi ea agi, ak gwahearan ng'eanyiini, ak aseasa geawooschi fuga saang'a geegooneasa ng'eanyiini ghoah hearaniischoodeanya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eeshiina gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ghoayaaji banyeega sea foojeandaanyi, nea ghoabwachi sanaamajeega nea ghoabwarji buuneeda, heapi? Gajageanda ng'eanyiini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaghuschi dabiteang'wa bea ng'ucheeda, goosinyi ng'asheega munyas, ak gaba ng'eedeeni mideayi sea gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi, heapi? Gajageanda ng'eanyiini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideabideati. Aba huumwa fugiga mida ng'eanyiida was raghoonyeandean gaygoosha aba ng'uta, nea siida mida mooheeda, gaydearuuta ghwaak diyeanga ng'weani, nea gea mida jeeda museasooda, ea gwaleadinga gayghabwar dawni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'eanyiida gaydanung' ghoah raghoonyeanda manda gil, nea ghwarjeeda giimuustaanyi gaydanung' goosha, ak giijeega Israeli gayghoah raghoonyeanda, nea manda siida jea ghang'ata gwasik jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA inyas ghaanung' ghoah ng'eanyiida raghoonyeanda manda gil aba ng'asheega nyaawa sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gideadu rukwiideayda ng'asheega sibaneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea ang'iing'i siida, fugaagu gabaloola iitaang'u aba murdeeda ghamarda, ea gidaghuudajeega gealga nyaawa, nea gaba siisi eeniisa nuut, ‘asi eeweaya eeleeysiiniit ana ng'ashaan gil leabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa ghapkaanda headaang'u gidabuweaniida buuneeda. Ak goobiida madeadaang'u gawuurji fugeasu, ak ghwayiiy ng'asheagaagu ak ea masina, nea aba ghuusiga nyaawa gwahinda geat gil mideawa bariinyeega saang'a nea aba jeesinga nyaawa gagasa nyageadayda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, ang'iing'i aba heeda nyaawa guwuurjeewi duumda miy muuchi, bea siida ammu sarmeeda nea ghoamu ghwalas muuchi dabita sarmeeda aba gideaba ghwayiiy ng'asheagaagu ak ea meesina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak suh iriguun inyas gwasa, ak aba huumwa gaygwasa, abeeda gayghwanal gideaba sibaneeda gwanda bugusta nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
